      "sourceTextSha256": "2d4f7b32a10175cc5a46ab47066a404f4d30a4da6c55eedc9392b2e49b7e95a1",
      "text": "Day 5 · After breakfast, transfer to Rio de Janeiro airport for your flight to Foz do Iguaçu; your driver meets you on arrival for the transfer to your hotel. In the afternoon, a guided tour of the Brazilian side of the falls: scenic walkways along the canyon offer spectacular views of countless cascades surrounded by lush Atlantic rainforest, leading to the impressive Devil’s Throat, where you feel the power of the water and admire the rainbows in the spray. Optional: the Macuco Safari boat adventure or the colourful Bird Park.",
